      "value": "@{5bbbf6aa17bab877dd8bc723|full_name}: No, the screenshot taken by F12 with VRC alone is different from Steam.\nIt is fixed at 1920x1080, the same as VR.\nVRC screenshots internally render different resolutions, which can cause lag under heavy load.\nI'm running VRC at 1600x900, but still generating a 1080p image when I generate a screenshot.",
