      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Earlier this year we updated VRChat's camera!\n\nYou can now choose a resolution. Our presets go up to 8k, but if you'd like to choose your own resolution, please customize the configuration file: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/configuration-file",
