  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm not to caught up on the topic but I know in certain games (apart from using a feature like Ansel (nvidia))\nthere are an option to have screenshots be taken at a much higher resolution than the game/screen resolution\n(tho only Overwatch comes to mind at the moment)\nIt would be nice if there was an option to have the image taken with the camera be captured at a higher resolution. At least up to 4K to make for some nicer pictures and all.\n\nCurrently the pictures comes out in 1080p witch technically is only 2 Megapixels\n4K would be 8 Megapixel and I think that would be a decent compromise to not suffer the same big freeze that seems to occur if one tries to take a super high resolution screenshot in Overwatch",
